# Property tax estimate honesty

When changing face Property tax dollars, tax year tiles, mill-levy line dollars, Realware / valuation-history extracts, or `propertyTaxEstimateMode`, keep these contracts. Do not invent county estimate totals the Assessor UI does not publish. Do not invent a second face formula that can disagree with the mill-levy stack.

## Face tile (`propertyTaxEstimateMode`)

- **Default (`levyStackDollars`):** Face $ === mill-levy stack $ via `annualTaxDollarsForLevyStack` (dual-base when school ≠ local; else single local base). Arapahoe and any county without a published face tax total use this. Assessor Levy.aspx may be mills-only — still label **Est. property tax**; do not claim face $ is county-published.
- **Douglas (`realwareTaxDollars`):** Realware `taxDollars` + `alternateTaxDollars` for the face year. Fail closed if missing. **Never** silent fallback to assessed × total mills. Stack must reconcile to that face (± whole-dollar bucket rounding) when history loads.
- **Resident face label (all counties that show the tile):** **Est. property tax** (not Est. on every `$`). Popover: estimate vs tax statement (not face vs stack divergence).
- Helper: `src/lib/propertyTaxEstimate.ts`. Mode lives on `CountyConfig`, not a feature flag.

## Tax year provenance

When valuation history is loaded, Tax year follows the Realware face year that matches pin assessed (not mill-PDF title alone). See `src/lib/parcelSummaryYears.ts`.

## Levy-line dollars (county-agnostic)

- Dual-base when school assessed is known and differs from local: school authorities × school assessed; other lines × local. Equal or missing school → single local base.
- Classifier: authority-chain `family === "school"` or name match (`SCHOOL DIST` / `School District` / `School`/`Schools`). Helper: `src/lib/levyLineAssessedBase.ts`.
- Face and stack share that helper under `levyStackDollars`. Never ship local × total mills as a competing face total.
- Arapahoe `schoolAssessedTotal` is DPT-computed at build (not a Main Parcel column). Treat unreproduced Assessor mismatch claims as not a bug until a concrete PIN shows Assessor Assessed School Value ≠ that figure.

## Gates

- Vitest: `levyStackDollars` face === stack (dual-base golden); naive single-base ≠ dual when school ≠ local; Realware face ≠ mills product + stack↔Realware face; Douglas e2e face/stack on synthetic fixture.
- Do not drive third-party Assessor SPAs in merge-gate Playwright.
